<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Support — Canned Responses (Launch Day)</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Support — Canned Responses (Launch Day)</h1>
<p>Founder personalises the first line; the body is pre-approved. Refund + pricing decisions are founder-only.</p>
<h2>Payment failed at checkout</h2>
<blockquote><p>Hi {name}, thanks for trying {{ product }}. The Stripe error you saw was on our side — we're investigating and will reach back inside 30 minutes. Sorry for the hiccup.</p></blockquote>
<h2>Login broken after signup</h2>
<blockquote><p>Hi {name}, I see your account was created but the activation email may have been delayed. I just resent it. If it still doesn't arrive within 5 minutes, reply here and I'll activate it manually.</p></blockquote>
<h2>&quot;Where is feature X?&quot;</h2>
<blockquote><p>Hi {name}, that one is on the roadmap (planned for {{ quarter }}). I'm tracking it here: {{ roadmap_link }}. Today's launch focuses on {{ core_scope }}. Happy to chat about your use case.</p></blockquote>
<h2>Refund request</h2>
<blockquote><p>Hi {name}, I'll personally look at this in the next few hours and respond before {time}. Your access is paused in the meantime so you won't be charged again. Sorry it didn't work out.</p></blockquote>
<h2>&quot;Is the site down?&quot;</h2>
<blockquote><p>Yes, we hit a hiccup at {time}; details on the status page: {{ status_link }}. ETA to restore: {{ window }}. We'll email everyone once it's back. Thanks for your patience.</p></blockquote>
</body></html>
